text = "As our hero,
Marguerite,
defeated
the Countess, Lucy,
she looked in fear.

Time travel is nothing
to take lightly.

For upon trying to
change fate, she
simply created,

another.

For this \"timeline\"
was not hers."

[node name="Label3" type="Label" parent="." unique_id=456823349]
layout_mode = 0
