theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 64
text = "But this was not 
a crusade of
\"righteous fury,\"
it was an act of
revenge.

For in another time,
she lost her love to
the Countess, and
was turned to a
vampire herself.

She would take the
throne and wait to
see her beloved

...once more. "

